# the receiver `table`: unit_s7_prim_cross over its own convert.lm2 whose columns are named in the quoted
# spelling, (class: `from`) ... (tests/unit_s7_tbl_quoted_table.lm2): a quoted name is the same name as its
# plain one, so the conversion finds its columns by name: Entry 7.

fn: go () int
    int: a 1
    size_t: b 2U
    a: b
    return: a

int: k
k: go()
if: k = 2
    sendMessage: exit(exit_code: 7; stdout: ""; stderr: "")
    return
sendMessage: exit(exit_code: 1; stdout: ""; stderr: "")
return
